# 21x80 — the smallest height with the mark (TUI-DESIGN-3 §3.1 WORDMARK_MIN_ROWS): the mark shows; the palette (8 rows) fits beside it
# (rule 1 + mark 5 + palette 8 + console 5 = 19 = the budget), so `/` never hands the mark off; Esc closes the palette; a 6-row draft fits too
expect \x1b\[\?25l
expect step 0/
expect ◆(?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)* (?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)*\d+\.\d+\.\d+
expect sess \$
sleep 0.3
send /
expect Tab
sleep 0.4
mark palette
send \x1b
sleep 0.3
send \x03
expect Say hi
send /exit
sleep 0.2
send \r
eof
